<title>UK: Rheinboden Hypo sets 200 million mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Rheinboden Hypo sets 200 million mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Sal. Oppenheim jr. &amp; Cie KGaA.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINBODEN HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.0	MATURITY   *07.AUG.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.90    PAY DATE  S-07.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    DDF	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO AUG 1997, THEN 5.0 PCT IF NOT CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>	     S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		 OEEFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 653</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
